DESCRIPTION:Dylan Carlino is a hilariously funny comedian\, writer and acto
 r with a genuinely unique point of view. After beginning his career in the 
 Berkshires\, he spent several years in Portland\, OR before moving to Austi
 n\, TX where he won the Austin's Funniest competition in 2023. Dylan's been
  featured in multiple festivals including the Mass Moca Comedy Festival\, t
 he Moontower Comedy Festival and he was presented by Netflix is a Joke in t
 heir "Featuring..." showcase in 2024. Dylan host's the podcast\, SOME OF TH
 IS IS BAD\, w/ comedian Colton Dowling and his own podcast\, FEELIN' GIRLY.
  Recently\, Dylan's audience has grown to over 1.8 million followers across
